    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">rẽ bluetooth</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android só ty nẽ app ki dispositivo bluetooth tã vũ, no ki jag se ty nẽ, se app ty rẽ bluetooth. é té ylih ta ty nẽ kimẽ kutulunan ty carro, no té se ty nẽ jĩ nũ jĩ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">nĩ: kutulunan kimẽ tẽ ukré dedu se vũ, nĩ nũ ty rĩ no nĩ nũ ty fág.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">nĩ ty: kutulunan bluetooth ty ukré nũ tud. rég jĩ ta rĩ, no wé ga ty nĩ pag nu stinísi android.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">tẽn</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">tukré gĩ ta kí servisu fundu, no android ty ag app kãgó ty fág pa ty nẽ tẽn dum se ta kí.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">nĩ: tẽn ta ty nẽ ki ta kré sãgí, ke úniku nẽ ty tukré gĩ ta ty rĩ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">nĩ ty: tukré gĩ ta rĩ no ta kré. android só ty nẽ tẽn se.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">rẽ kré dum wé ség</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">android ta pãrá apps ki ty ta nũ pag mẽ no ty tír rẽ, ke gera ylih a ty nũ kré até ku wé ta fám tena. ség prũ ke app ta jag pa, ó ty fág agora.</string>
